OL,3,GNEWSABridge replacement delayed due to
OL,4,Asummer heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe replacement of a key 85-year-old
OL,7,Fbridge which has been shut since 2025
OL,8,Fhas been delayed due to the summer's
OL,9,Fheatwaves.
OL,11,FWinterstoke Road Bridge, a key
OL,12,Ftransport link through
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare, was supposed to
OL,14,Freopen to traffic in the summer of
OL,15,F2027, however North Somerset Council
OL,16,Fsaid this has been delayed to early
OL,17,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
