OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSABridge replacement delayed due to
OL,4,Asummer heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe delay to the new #11m bridge, which
OL,7,Fclosed to traffic in November 2025, was
OL,8,Fcaused by the summer's persistent hot
OL,9,Fweather sparking safety concerns for
OL,10,Fthe railway track.
OL,12,FNorth Somerset Council leader Mike Bell
OL,13,Fapologised for the delay, adding the
OL,14,Fcouncil's priority "is to get the route
OL,15,Fopen to vehicles as early as possible".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
